{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "or-run-migration-2026-11-25",
		"name": "OpenRegister Run Migration API",
		"description": "A run parked at a user task is migrated to a version that renamed the step, and finishes there (change migrate-run-between-versions, task 4.1).\n\nVersion 1 waits at a user task `review`; version 2 renames it `assess`. A run started on version 1 parks with its task in the inbox. Migrating without a mapping is refused with 422 naming `review`; a dry run with the mapping says the token lands on `assess` and writes nothing; the real migration moves the run to version 2 at `assess` with a `migrated` log entry, and the task moves with the step. Completing the task then finishes the run on version 2 in the completing request (the task's `advance: all`).\n\nWhy Newman and not tests/e2e/ci/run-migration.spec.ts, which the task names: every step is an API call, and gate-19 puts API contracts in Newman.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"event": [
		{
			"listen": "prerequest",
			"script": {
				"type": "text/javascript",
				"exec": [
					"pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'OCS-APIRequest', value: 'true' });"
				]
			}
		}
	],
